  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Network shuttering happens me more often, especially if i am for long time in VRChat, then network part is getting worser and worser.\n\nDid rejoin world to fix the sync, but that will not hold up much long, and everyone shuttered again in movement.\n\nThis shuttering movement will cause big delay and i am not more in sync with others.\n\nhttps://clips.twitch.tv/SnappySmoggyOpossumANELE is good example: i saw on stream other is headpatting me, but i didn't see it earlier, and then later she comes actually to me and headpat me. Way much later!\n\nBecause the network shutter, where you see all players moves not more smooth, you will miss interaction with others because it will extremely delayed.\n\nI think it's part of poor Network IK.",
